# Vendored binary frameworks (llama.cpp xcframework lives outside git, see ADR-007)
Packages/ModelRuntime/Vendor/

# Model weights (stay in ~/Library/Application Support/KeyType/Models, never in the repo)
#
# `Models/` was unanchored, so it matched *any* directory of that name at any depth — including
# `KeyType/Logic/Models/`, which is source. Two files lived outside version control for months as a
# result, one of them the entire selection-toolbar implementation: the repo did not build from a
# clean clone and nobody noticed, because everyone building it already had the files. Anchored and
# narrowed to the one directory that ever held weights.
*.gguf
/Models/

# Completion benchmark local/private data and generated reports
KeyTypeBench-20260603/Private/
KeyTypeBench-20260603/Results/
KeyTypeBench-20260603/Datasets/private/
KeyTypeBench-20260603/Datasets/local/
Packages/KeyTypeBench/Sources/KeyTypeBench/Datasets/private/

